{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118085400916-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118093254\"/><p>港鐵香港大學站有信號設備故障。</p><p>今晨(18日)8時46分，港鐵表示，由於港島綫香港大學站有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。現時港島綫列車服務受阻，來往堅尼地城站及柴灣站的行車時間預計需要額外5-8分鐘。請乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:43:44.135811+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:57:19.945471+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:37:02.586402+00:00","content_hash":"6f4fe02237993f6ddcc95223f31bc090ef03529a76ec900d6dda4f950c414e76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}